hanged: Free tools, no forced signups, no BS. A huge thank you to everyone who has been using the tools and giving feedback. The site is back to being faster than ever. If you notice anything weird, drop a comment below Ready to try the tools yourself? Scan up to 300 links, check WHOIS, or build UTM links — all 100% free, no login required. [Try the Dead Link Checker Now →](https://sitetoolsbox.com/tool.php?slug=deadlink) Keep building, sitetoolsbox [← Back to all articles](/articles.php) < 🚨 json {"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebSite","name":"","url":"https://sitetoolsbox.com","potentialAction":{"@type":"SearchAction","target":"https://sitetoolsbox.com/search.php?q={search_term_string}","queryinput":"required name=search_term_string"}} {"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","headline":"🛡️ Update on recent traffic anomalies: We're hardening our defenses","description":"Hey everyone,

